    "text": "By Matt Chapman ,\n13 hours ago CORNELIUS – A proposal to build a hotel on the northwest corner of the intersection of Mayes and Sam Furr roads, an area where the boundaries of the three north Mecklenburg towns essentially come together, was met with pushback from Cornelius, Davidson and Huntersville residents during a May 4 public hearing. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 1",
